  "id": "BIT-parse-2026-116801",
  "summary": "Parse Server 9.0.0 before 9.10.5 ACL Bypass via $relatedTo Query",
  "details": "Parse Server before 8.6.105 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.5 does not validate the owning object reference in $relatedTo relation queries, so supplying a query operator instead of an object ID bypasses the owning-object ACL check. A client with read access to at least one object of the owning class can disclose which readable objects are linked to owning objects it cannot read.",
